                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad5204fc-86c7-467d-a339-527d738c48dd",
                                                "sense_id": "29ba214a-cdd9-35f0-a9fe-f0e0834adc8d",
                                                "text": "Now, covered concrete troughs to house the cables are laid parallel with the railway lines, cheapening maintenance because of improved accessibility for inspection and repair."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a93496b3-6739-4fe7-99cd-9a40182d25dc",
                                                "sense_id": "29ba214a-cdd9-35f0-a9fe-f0e0834adc8d",
                                                "text": "It just clips on the front of the stage without any special trough, has no great power and occupies only one dimmer, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a52ae39-6e55-3917-971e-af5f48531390",
                                        "entry_id": "b005b19d-9c53-32cf-b033-0ee0dbea7936",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any similarly shaped container.",
                                            "A rectangular container used for washing or rinsing clothes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "New-Zealand"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "106ad5f0-4554-424c-a95e-96f18c86d214",
                                                "sense_id": "7a52ae39-6e55-3917-971e-af5f48531390",
                                                "text": "Ernest threw his paint brushes into a kind of trough he had fashioned from sheet metal that he kept in the sink."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a02b637-7c21-3246-853f-a7ece91fece4",
                                        "entry_id": "b005b19d-9c53-32cf-b033-0ee0dbea7936",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short, narrow canal designed to hold water until it drains or evaporates."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b7bea15-707c-462b-8e77-630cddcaff10",
                                                "sense_id": "3a02b637-7c21-3246-853f-a7ece91fece4",
                                                "text": "There was a small trough that the sump pump emptied into; it was filled with mosquito larvae."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b603caa1-6f0c-3033-bb19-8f0adbd6a38c",
                                        "entry_id": "b005b19d-9c53-32cf-b033-0ee0dbea7936",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An undivided metal urinal (plumbing fixture)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
