                                            "To eat in a vulgar style, as if from a trough."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2df5c06-9425-4d5d-b22f-70974f719621",
                                                "sense_id": "a1ff1842-745b-3ba2-96a5-b9a3ab46a660",
                                                "text": "He troughed his way through three meat pies."
                                            }
